# Title: CobaltStrike Named Pipe Pattern Regex
# ID: 0e7163d4-9e19-4fa7-9be6-000c61aad77a
# Status: test
# Level: critical
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-07-30
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.stealth, attack.t1055
# Description: Detects the creation of a named pipe matching a pattern used by CobaltStrike Malleable C2 profiles
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((PipeName:/\\mojo\.5688\.8052\.(?:183894939787088877|35780273329370473)[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\wkssvc_?[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\ntsvcs[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\DserNamePipe[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\SearchTextHarvester[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\mypipe-(?:f|h)[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\windows\.update\.manager[0-9a-f]{2,3}/) OR (PipeName:/\\ntsvcs_[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\scerpc_?[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\PGMessagePipe[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\MsFteWds[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\f4c3[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\fullduplex_[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\msrpc_[0-9a-f]{4}/) OR (PipeName:/\\win\\msrpc_[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\f53f[0-9a-f]{2}$/) OR (PipeName:/\\rpc_[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\spoolss_[0-9a-f]{2}/) OR (PipeName:/\\Winsock2\\CatalogChangeListener-[0-9a-f]{3}-0,/))
